# Paths left over from the Hatena Blog that lived on this domain until 2026-11.
# Feeds and the archive move permanently; old entries go to the blog index for now and get
# their own rules when an article is migrated (see README).
/feed /rss.xml 301
/feed/* /rss.xml 301
/rss /rss.xml 301
/rss/* /rss.xml 301
/archive /blog/ 301
/archive/* /blog/ 301
/entry/* /blog/ 302
